g the comments on Repo, RepoNames, SpecTimeoutS or ImplementSpec."], "max_wall_hours": 24}, "attempt_id": null, "event_type": "mission_amended", "mission_id": "M-2", "prev_sha256": "a0b1adcd0bcf824f45f9c77893b4ca251664cf74b514770c77f716635388d948", "plan_node_id": null, "cause_event_id": null, "event_stream_id": "mission:M-2"}, {"at": "2026-10-16T04:12:07.842781+00:00", "seq": 16, "txid": 61980754, "sha256": "9fd1c6bef09412b62f53d9c516ad42560ba216f3ebdc53ac87fd688d1a97ccf6", "task_id": "t_01M51EHZ92V5F2PRB7JCZVHTQ3", "actor_id": "seat:chief_of_staff", "event_id": 82, "body_json": {"repo": "bifrost-platform", "role": "implement", "title": "Document how to add a repository to store.Repos", "base_commit": "01a5c62da88c98d37b148e292e032707bc6dbe65", "off_plan_reason": "planned by task t_01M51EG5TBPF16TXV6SGY5E5M2"}, "attempt_id": null, "event_type": "task_proposed", "mission_id": "M-2", "prev_sha256": "0e428170cfab071d7d60c2ae0e11da8aed6524a86d5815495e2c98beac18b2a5", "plan_node_id": null, "cause_event_id": null, "event_stream_id": "mission:M-2"}, {"at": "2026-10-16T04:12:07.845441+00:00", "seq": 17, "txid": 61980754, "sha256": "3b74694d194dc24cfb264a321e0d9b6063bcf43ed710906e0ddc1593d7b59157", "task_id": "t_01M51EG5TBPF16TXV6SGY5E5M2", "actor_id": "seat:chief_of_staff", "event_id": 83, "body_json": {"why": "CLAUDE.md says code identifiers and UI strings are English, and the surrounding Go comments are all English.", "dropped": "A Chinese comment, which would match the language the goal was written in.", "reverse": "Translate the comment in a follow-up task.", "decision": "Write the comment in English, like every other comment in the file."}, "attempt_id": null, "event_type": "decision_recorded", "mission_id": "M-2", "prev_sha256": "9fd1c6bef09412b62f53d9c516ad42560ba216f3ebdc53ac87fd688d1a97ccf6", "plan_node_id": null, "cause_event_id": null, "event_stream_id": "mission:M-2"}, {"at": "2026-10-16T04:12:07.846749+00:00", "seq": 18, "txid": 61980754, "sha256": "87a6473d1f